    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace the Art of Wandering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a breathtaking world where wandering leads to wonder\u2014a place where creativity and exploration intertwine. This hand-crafted open realm invites you to discover its secrets at your own pace, with no dangers to evade or countdowns to race against. Here, your only mission is to experience the joy of discovery and express your artistic vision across an untamed landscape.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/671da80a2e0230c87965e86080f0bc5b.poster.avif?t=1752801805\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/671da80a2e0230c87965e86080f0bc5b.webm?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/671da80a2e0230c87965e86080f0bc5b.mp4?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through diverse environments from towering mountains to lush valleys, deep seas, and mysterious caves. Gather unique materials across the terrain to craft stunning environmental art installations\u2014balance stones into impossible sculptures, arrange colorful mosaics, or create melodic wind chimes that sing with the breeze.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/f4b23cc3299d8e9fc0669fecd3ab4f49.poster.avif?t=1752801805\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/f4b23cc3299d8e9fc0669fecd3ab4f49.webm?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/f4b23cc3299d8e9fc0669fecd3ab4f49.mp4?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Your Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no wrong way to experience this world. Fish in tranquil waters, mine for rare resources, chop wood for your creations, fly over breathtaking vistas, or restore ancient ruins to their former glory. Scale cliff faces, dive into the depths of the ocean, or find the perfect vantage point to photograph the changing living landscape under dynamic weather.\u00a0Form bonds with the diverse wildlife that inhabits this peaceful realm. From tiny critters to larger companions, the animals you encounter can be befriended and even domesticated, becoming partners in your exploration. As you explore and discover, you'll earn Inspiration Points and uncover fragments of classic poetry and literature that resonate with your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Meditation for the Artistic Soul</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Those Who Wander is more than just a game\u2014it's a meditation, a canvas, and a sanctuary designed for the artistic soul seeking respite from the chaos of everyday life. Take the scenic route and discover the rewards that await those who wander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace the Art of Wandering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a breathtaking world where wandering leads to wonder\u2014a place where creativity and exploration intertwine. This hand-crafted open realm invites you to discover its secrets at your own pace, with no dangers to evade or countdowns to race against. Here, your only mission is to experience the joy of discovery and express your artistic vision across an untamed landscape.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/671da80a2e0230c87965e86080f0bc5b.poster.avif?t=1752801805\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/671da80a2e0230c87965e86080f0bc5b.webm?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/671da80a2e0230c87965e86080f0bc5b.mp4?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through diverse environments from towering mountains to lush valleys, deep seas, and mysterious caves. Gather unique materials across the terrain to craft stunning environmental art installations\u2014balance stones into impossible sculptures, arrange colorful mosaics, or create melodic wind chimes that sing with the breeze.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/f4b23cc3299d8e9fc0669fecd3ab4f49.poster.avif?t=1752801805\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/f4b23cc3299d8e9fc0669fecd3ab4f49.webm?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542260/extras/f4b23cc3299d8e9fc0669fecd3ab4f49.mp4?t=1752801805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Your Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no wrong way to experience this world. Fish in tranquil waters, mine for rare resources, chop wood for your creations, fly over breathtaking vistas, or restore ancient ruins to their former glory. Scale cliff faces, dive into the depths of the ocean, or find the perfect vantage point to photograph the changing living landscape under dynamic weather.\u00a0Form bonds with the diverse wildlife that inhabits this peaceful realm. From tiny critters to larger companions, the animals you encounter can be befriended and even domesticated, becoming partners in your exploration. As you explore and discover, you'll earn Inspiration Points and uncover fragments of classic poetry and literature that resonate with your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Meditation for the Artistic Soul</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Those Who Wander is more than just a game\u2014it's a meditation, a canvas, and a sanctuary designed for the artistic soul seeking respite from the chaos of everyday life. Take the scenic route and discover the rewards that await those who wander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "All Those Who Wander is a peaceful exploration and art-making game set in a vast, forgotten landscape. Gather materials and creating stunning environmental installations. No enemies, no rush\u2014just your creativity and the freedom to get lost in a world that rewards those who take the scenic route.",
